{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113400/extras/a9686aa17a61458df895f2b3797a1c88.gif?t=1762221174\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113400/extras/a9686aa17a61458df895f2b3797a1c88.poster.avif?t=1762221174\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winter of 1990. You\u2019ve come to a mountain cabin for a holiday with five women from your household staff, but a blizzard leaves you stranded. This is no ordinary vacation. They are the enemies who murdered your parents, and they\u2019ve come to coax you into handing over your share of the estate. They are your enemies. Eight days remain \u2014 kill them. Protect what\u2019s yours.\u00a0However, the moment you are discovered, everything is over. They have simply suffered an \u201c<strong>unfortunate accident</strong>\u201d at an isolated mountain lodge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113400/extras/0255bcbd43acbcd22819f6b8a930756e.gif?t=1762221174\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113400/extras/0255bcbd43acbcd22819f6b8a930756e.poster.avif?t=1762221174\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >640 \u00d7 360 resolution, graphics that perfectly recreate EGA using only the IBM standard 16 colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound that perfectly reproduces 1990s MIDI using an OPL2 soundfont</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point-and-click, simple gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isolation, tension, and a dark atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113400/extras/adf16a4cf02cdc51828b56cf34156175.apng?t=1762221174\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113400/extras/adf16a4cf02cdc51828b56cf34156175.poster.avif?t=1762221174\" class=\"bb_img\" width=480 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your creativity: combine items and destroy your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Act naturally so you won\u2019t be suspected. Perhaps you might even draw one of them to your side?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings supported (of course).</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4113400?t=1762221174","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4113400?t=1762221174","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113400/95b9abf3cebee86d70c7d1c59887e9f003ee5f31/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762221174","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113400/95b9abf3cebee86d70c7d1c59887e9f003ee5f31/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762221174","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113400/extras/a9686aa17a61458df895f2b3797a1c88.gif?t=1762221174\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113400/extras/a9686aa17a61458df895f2b3797a1c88.poster.avif?t=17